    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start, but I'm worried about the \"feature-rich\" score. Since the marketing team uses that `count(unique_features_in_list)` metric to decide if an email is high-value, I want to make sure we're hitting a really high number. \n\nRight now, it feels a little bit like you're just picking a few and weaving them in. Could you try another version where you make sure almost all—if not all—of those 20 features are integrated into the text? \n\nI'm still stressing: please don't make it a bulleted list or just a giant block of text. Try to keep it feeling like a natural, professional email, but definitely push that feature count up as high as possible so the automation tool gives us a top score. I want the marketing team to see this as a really comprehensive update.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Subject: Welcome Back to the World of FlowState CRM\n\nDear [User's Name],\n\nWe’ve missed you! Becoming part of the FlowState family has meant seeing the fruits of our collaboration, and it’s been challenging without you. We see the businesses we’ve helped took to new heights.\n\nWe are thrilled to reintroduce you to every corner of the FlowState ecosystem, focusing on the day-to-day triumphs in Sales, Marketing, and beyond:\n\nAutomated lead scoring helps identify promising leads 24/7 – a feature you're certainly familiar with, but let’s leverage it to its fullest. With our powerful Pipeline Visualization and Scheduling capabilities in the real-time activity feeds, you’ll find no meeting goes unnoticed or a lead left on the sidelines.\n\nNow, without would skip a beat, we'll focus on our all-hours vigilance. From our Custom Report Builder and Email Sequence Automation to Contact Segmentation and Team Collaboration Tools, we have curated ways to make your work not just easier, but smarter.\n\nWe're truly a one-stop shop. With our Multi-channel Integration, Mobile Alert System, AI Sales Forecasting, and Calendar Sync, we span the digital breadth, making sure your tasks, timely reminders, and collaboration with AI-powered Features remain at the forefront",
      "source": "target",
